Subject: New release of Distance for Windows; update on recent releases of R packages
Message-ID: <CCYIbxq6Bgc.BFYntQ7gBQAJ@distance-sampling.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/distance-sampling/c/CCYIbxq6Bgc/m/BFYntQ7gBQAJ>
